
### 1. Registrar beneficiario
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/beneficiaries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "12345678",
  "alias": "Proveedor principal",
  "holderName": "Juan Perez",
  "clabe": "032180000118359719",
  "maxAmount": 15000.00,
  "email": "juan@example.com"
}

### 2. Consultar beneficiario por ID
# Sustituir 1 por el ID generado
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/beneficiaries/1

### 3. Listar beneficiarios activos
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/beneficiaries?customerId=12345678

### 4. Desactivar beneficiario
# Sustituir 1 por el ID generado
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/beneficiaries/1/deactivate
